# Vehicle category: how a vehicle is set up when a drive begins (M-0141).

set-vehicle-setup = Vehicle set-up
set-vehicle-setup-desc = How far the vehicle is prepared when a drive begins: 0 nothing is started, 0.25 electrics on, 0.5 ignition in the drive position, 0.75 engine running, 1 ready to drive (parking brake released). Applies to the next vehicle; raising it also continues a vehicle that has not got that far.
set-vehicle-fuel = Fuel
set-vehicle-fuel-desc = Fuel in the tank at the start, as a share of the tank (0 empty, 1 full). Applies to the next vehicle.
set-vehicle-lights = Lights at the start
set-vehicle-lights-desc = The lights that are switched on once the electrics are on. Applies to the next vehicle.
set-opt-start-lights-off = Off
set-opt-start-lights-parking = Parking lights
set-opt-start-lights-dipped = Dipped beam
